OL,3,GNEWSA'Get a mammogram,' says man who
OL,4,Alost wife to cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose wife died of breast cancer
OL,7,Fis encouraging women over 70 to request
OL,8,Fregular mammograms.
OL,10,FTony Foster, from Church Crookham in
OL,11,FHampshire, said his wife Sue had no
OL,12,Fsymptoms before she had the test, which
OL,13,Fcan detect early signs of breast
OL,14,Fcancer.
OL,16,FHe told the BBC Sue only had a
OL,17,Fmammogram "by chance" after a friend
OL,18,Fsuggested it to her.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
